	(text "STARTING SETTINGS (circuits/transistor-preamp/feedback-board.ts)\nEach leg's total resistance and, in parens, what to dial the pot itself to (the leg total minus its fixed floor resistor, where it has one).\n  RV1 leg 470k (trim 0)  RV2 leg 150k (trim 103k)  RV3 leg 1.8k (trim 800R)  RV4 leg 0 (trim 0)\nOther 2B variant: RV1 leg about 1.3M and lift R2 (no base-to-ground leg).\nFully unbypassed emitter: pull C1.\nOUTPUT: Q2 is an emitter follower (no trim). R5/R6 bias its base below the\nnaive 4.5 V by an amount that depends on beta - measure Q2's base and emitter\nvoltages, V_BE and I_E = V_E / 1.5k."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.066 259.842 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cb0e4c7c-10a3-4c4a-b08b-9d2eb9e417b3")
	)
